WEBVTT

00:27:57.864 --> 00:28:01.932
in societies that are more
about individualism.

00:28:01.956 --> 00:28:08.956
(Music)

00:28:21.101 --> 00:28:22.697
CA: So, I'd love to turn, Kai-Fu,

00:28:22.721 --> 00:28:26.907
to your analysis of the competitive
situation between US and China,

00:28:26.931 --> 00:28:31.914
what each country is bringing
to the development of AI.